  (text
    "bzzy LED ring: 16 x WS2812B-2020 around the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.69"
    (at 25 20 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 029d7c30-c124-46ef-be6f-2cfe6ea1257d))
  (text
    "J1 is three wire pads (5V, GPIO17, GND) and J2 one more (GPIO18, top button). Wire them to the Waveshare board's pads."
    (at 25 25 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 147df194-8844-45c3-8f0b-77a989ad5852))
  (text
    "U1 lifts the 3.3 V data to 5 V logic. R1 keeps the line low while the ESP32 boots."
    (at 25 45 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 4622d1f3-2ced-41fc-8545-5a520c492bb6))
  (text
    "LED chain: D1 (bottom-left) runs clockwise to D16. TP1 is the chain's DOUT, for adding more LEDs later."
    (at 25 108 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 9799648c-9eba-4701-8a1e-07b31f571abf))
